        href: https://traefik.${DOMAIN}
        description: sieve — reverse proxy dashboard
    - Pi-hole:
        href: https://pihole.${DOMAIN}
        description: sieve — DNS / ad-block
    - Headscale:
        href: https://headscale.${DOMAIN}
        description: sieve — tailnet control plane (no web UI, health check only)
